SUMMARY:SDSC-Connect: Connecting Digital Environmental Sciences
LOCATION:Central Bern venue to be announced
DESCRIPTION:A day in Bern on making environmental data usable across discip
 lines and institutions — data access and sharing\, data infrastructure\,
  and the role of machine learning and AI across climate\, ecology\, hydrol
 ogy\, the cryosphere\, natural hazards and agriculture\, with keynotes\, i
 nvited talks\, break-outs and a poster fair. Seats are limited and the ven
 ue is still to be announced.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss Data Science Center\n\nDe
 tails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/sdsc-connect-env
 ironmental-sciences-bern-2027/
